	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　Helman'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　Planned City Path'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	!VAR0516 : 462!
	\L_00fcc:
	\L_00f78:
	ZH 1:
	'Hyahyahya...'
	\L_0109d:
	ZH 1:
	'Hyahyahyahyahya!!'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	\L_00fb0:
	ZH 1:
	'As usual,'
	\L_0109d:
	ZH 1:
	'Olhound gave some youths his'
	R
	'medicine to produce ultimate'
	R
	'warriors who would only live a'
	\L_0109d:
	ZH 1:
	'day.'
	\L_0109d:
	{VAR0130 = 1:
		ZH 1:
		'It was done so covertly that the'
		R
		'territory being captured by the'
		R
		'Leazas Army didn’t change'
		\L_0109d:
		ZH 1:
		'anything.'
		\L_0109d:
	}
	\L_01090:
	\L_00f78:
	ZH 1:
	'Now go!'
	R
	'Give Leazas a bloodbath!'
	\L_0109d:
	ZH 1:
	'Use those bodies my genius'
	R
	'self imparted on you!!'
	\L_0109d:
	ZH 1:
	'Hyahyahyahya!!'
	R
	'Kill, kill, kill!'
	\L_0109d:
	ZH 1:
	'Kill, kill them all, show'
	R
	'everyone the greatness of my'
	R
	'medicine!!'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	\L_00fb0:
	ZH 1:
	'Olhound cackled to the heavens'
	R
	'while the monsters headed to'
	R
	'battle like a wave parting'
	\L_0109d:
	ZH 1:
	'around him.'
