	\L_0103c:
	\L_00fe8:
	ZH 1:
	'King Rance.'
	R
	'A strange old man was found'
	R
	'hiding in a church.'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	\L_0104a:
	!VAR0516 : 462!
	\L_0103c:
	\L_00fe8:
	ZH 1:
	'Owowowowow... How could you do'
	R
	'this to a feeble old man?!'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	\L_01020:
	ZH 1:
	'Olhound was captured by'
	R
	'Rance’s subordinates.'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	\L_00f78:
	ZH 1:
	'...He certainly is strange.'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	\L_00fe8:
	ZH 1:
	'What are you talking about?'
	R
	'I’m just a feeble old man.'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	\L_00f78:
	ZH 1:
	'Nah. My intuition tells me'
	R
	'you’re dangerous. Definitely'
	R
	'strange.'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	\L_00fe8:
	ZH 1:
	'What basis do you have for'
	R
	'that?'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	\L_00f78:
	ZH 1:
	'None.'
	R
	'What I do have...'
	\L_0109d:
	ZH 1:
	'Is myself, who’s right about'
	R
	'everything!'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	\L_00fe8:
	ZH 1:
	'What nonsense!'
	R
	'I’m the one who’s right!!'
	R
	'Everything I make is perfect!!'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	\L_00f78:
	ZH 1:
	'Everything you make??'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	\L_00fe8:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s right. Such as... Oh yes.'
	R
	'An army of monsters to toy with'
	R
	'the Leazas Army, and...'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	\L_00f78:
	ZH 1:
	'What?'
	R
	'You made them?'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	\L_00fe8:
	ZH 1:
	'Hyahyahyahya.'
	R
	'That’s right.'
	R
	'Scared now?'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	\L_00f78:
	ZH 1:
	'Not really scared...'
	\L_0109d:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m thinking about how much shit'
	R
	'we had to deal with thanks to'
	R
	'them. Die!!'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	\L_00fb0:
	ZH 1:
	'　　＜slashhhh）'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	\L_00fe8:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyaaaaaaaaah!!!'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	\L_0104a:
	\L_00fb0:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance gave Olhound a'
	R
	'satisfying slash.'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	\L_00f78:
	ZH 1:
	'Hmph.'
	R
	'Killed a boring guy.'
	R
	'Let’s go.'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	\L_00fda:
	\L_00fb0:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance left Olhound there and'
	R
	'departed.'
	\L_0109d:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'.........'
	\L_0109d:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'......'
	\L_0109d:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'...'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	!VAR0516 : 462!
	\L_0103c:
	\L_00fe8:
	ZH 1:
	'Kh... Shit...'
	R
	'Why did this happen to me...?'
	R
	'Huh, Granny...?'
	\L_0109d:
	ZH 1:
	'　　（Granny）'
	R
	'............'
	\L_0109d:
	ZH 1:
	'　　（Granny）'
	R
	'Grampa...'
	R
	'Grampa...'
	\L_0109d:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh...'
	\L_0109d:
	ZH 1:
	'　　（Granny）'
	R
	'Grampa...'
	R
	'It’s what had to happen...'
	\L_0109d:
	ZH 1:
	'　　（Granny） It’s God’s punishment'
	R
	'for how much you extended your'
	R
	'lifespan...'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	\L_00fb0:
	ZH 1:
	'Granny spoke intelligently.'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	\L_00fe8:
	ZH 1:
	'Granny... Granny?'
	\L_0109d:
	ZH 1:
	'　　（Granny） Yes... Grampa...'
	R
	'Let’s get along again in the'
	R
	'afterlife...'
	\L_0109d:
	ZH 1:
	'Oh... Ooooh... Granny... I'
	R
	'finally get to be with you'
	R
	'again...'
	\L_0109d:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_0109d:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_0109d:
	\L_01090:
	\L_0104a:
	\L_01020:
	ZH 1:
	'Olhound and Granny both became'
	R
	'still.'
